  "description": "This set includes high-quality PNG and transparent PNG, PDF and SVG files, perfect for adding a touch of organization and fun to your planners, journals and other crafts. With a variety of cute and functional stickers, you’ll find everything you need to personalize your planning routine. Make your planners stand out and reflect your style with ease! You can print these files at home or in a print studio and cut them out with the scissors.\n– 4 different pages PNG and transparent PNG, PDF and SVG files in letter size (can be printed on A4 as well)\nDepending on your computer monitor and resolution, colors may appear different from the actual download. Therefore there may be some variance between the way colors look on your screen compare to the actual print.",
